HorizonKV and Krea autoregressive diffusion inference in FlagScale

This package combines the Wan model components used by HorizonKV and the dense
Krea efficiency baseline. Common T5, tokenizer, scheduler, embeddings, model
initialization and VAE code live in wan/. baseline_* modules retain the dense
attention, KV recomputation and temporal resampling differences; pipeline.py
is the production HorizonKV entry and baseline.py is the comparison entry.

