FlagScale modifications include frame retrieval, bounded GPU/host KV storage,
overlap execution, residency-aware selection, shared Wan components and separate
inference loops. The dense baseline preserves Krea's five-step schedule,
context reconstruction, boundary reencoding and streaming FP16 VAE. The server,
webcam/video input, training, research launchers and evaluation code are excluded.
Model tensor names remain compatible with the public checkpoints. No weights or
evaluation datasets are distributed with this package.
